		<td colspan="2"><font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="4">Can Triple Play baseball hit the curveball or does it go down swinging?</font><BR></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top"><img src='/images/Pics_boxes/2133.jpg' border='2' align='left'></td>
		<td valign="top" width="100%">
